  ('why-website-speed-wins-clients', 'Why website speed quietly wins you clients', 'Every second of load time costs enquiries. Here is what actually makes a site fast, and what to fix first.', 'A slow site does not look broken, it just loses people.

## What to measure

Look at **Largest Contentful Paint**, **Interaction to Next Paint** and **Cumulative Layout Shift**. Google uses all three.

## What to fix first

1. Oversized images
2. Render-blocking fonts and scripts
3. Slow hosting and no caching

Fix those and most sites get twice as fast in a week.', null, '[{"text":"PERFORMANCE"},{"text":"SEO"}]'::jsonb, 'Nova Studio', 4, '2026-09-01T09:00:00Z', true, null, null),
  ('ai-agents-for-small-teams', 'AI agents for small teams: where to start', 'Skip the hype. Pick one repetitive task, measure it, automate it. A practical guide.', 'The best first AI project is boring: a task your team repeats every day.

## Good first use cases

- Answering common customer questions
- Summarising calls and emails
- Sorting and tagging incoming leads

## Keep a human in the loop

Start with drafts a person approves. When the drafts are reliably good, let the agent act on its own.', null, '[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"AUTOMATION"}]'::jsonb, 'Nova Studio', 5, '2026-08-20T09:00:00Z', true, null, null),
  ('shopify-or-custom-store', 'Shopify, WooCommerce or custom: choosing your store', 'Each option fits a different stage of growth. How to choose without regretting it a year later.', '## Shopify

Fastest to launch, great apps, monthly fees.

## WooCommerce

Flexible and familiar if you already run WordPress.

## Custom

